{"slug":"l-q-y","ar":"ل ق ي","total":146,"core":"meeting; casting; receiving","forms":[{"ar":"أَلْقَىٰٓ","kind":"verb","form":4,"count":71,"gloss":"to throw, cast","word":null,"ex":{"s":7,"a":120,"p":1,"ar":["وَأُلْقِىَ","ٱلسَّحَرَةُ","سَـٰجِدِينَ"],"en":"And the magicians fell down in prostration [to Allah]"}},{"ar":"لِقَآء","kind":"verbal noun","form":3,"count":24,"gloss":"meeting","word":null,"ex":{"s":30,"a":16,"p":6,"ar":["وَأَمَّا","ٱلَّذِينَ","كَفَرُوا۟","وَكَذَّبُوا۟","بِـَٔايَـٰتِنَا","وَلِقَآئِ","ٱلْـَٔاخِرَةِ","فَأُو۟لَـٰٓئِكَ","فِى","ٱلْعَذَابِ","مُحْضَرُونَ"],"en":"But as for those who disbelieved and denied Our verses and the meeting of the Hereafter, those will be brought into the punishment [to remain]"}},{"ar":"لَقُ","kind":"verb","form":1,"count":14,"gloss":"to meet","word":null,"ex":{"s":33,"a":44,"p":3,"ar":["تَحِيَّتُهُمْ","يَوْمَ","يَلْقَوْنَهُۥ","سَلَـٰمٌ ۚ","وَأَعَدَّ","لَهُمْ","أَجْرًا","كَرِيمًا"],"en":"Their greeting the Day they meet Him will be, \"Peace.\" And He has prepared for them a noble reward"}},{"ar":"ٱلْتَقَى","kind":"verb","form":8,"count":7,"gloss":"to meet, encounter","word":null,"ex":{"s":55,"a":19,"p":3,"ar":["مَرَجَ","ٱلْبَحْرَيْنِ","يَلْتَقِيَانِ"],"en":"He released the two seas, meeting [side by side]"}},{"ar":"لَقَّىٰ","kind":"verb","form":2,"count":6,"gloss":"to grant; to cause to meet","word":null,"ex":{"s":27,"a":6,"p":2,"ar":["وَإِنَّكَ","لَتُلَقَّى","ٱلْقُرْءَانَ","مِن","لَّدُنْ","حَكِيمٍ","عَلِيمٍ"],"en":"And indeed, [O Muhammad], you receive the Qur'an from one Wise and Knowing"}},{"ar":"مُّلَٰقُوا","kind":"active participle","form":3,"count":4,"gloss":"meeting, one who will meet","word":null,"ex":{"s":2,"a":46,"p":4,"ar":["ٱلَّذِينَ","يَظُنُّونَ","أَنَّهُم","مُّلَـٰقُوا۟","رَبِّهِمْ","وَأَنَّهُمْ","إِلَيْهِ","رَٰجِعُونَ"],"en":"Who are certain that they will meet their Lord and that they will return to Him"}},{"ar":"تَلَقَّىٰٓ","kind":"verb","form":5,"count":4,"gloss":"to receive","word":null,"ex":{"s":50,"a":17,"p":2,"ar":["إِذْ","يَتَلَقَّى","ٱلْمُتَلَقِّيَانِ","عَنِ","ٱلْيَمِينِ","وَعَنِ","ٱلشِّمَالِ","قَعِيدٌ"],"en":"When the two receivers receive, seated on the right and on the left"}},{"ar":"مُّلْقُون","kind":"active participle","form":4,"count":3,"gloss":"throwers","word":null,"ex":{"s":26,"a":43,"p":7,"ar":["قَالَ","لَهُم","مُّوسَىٰٓ","أَلْقُوا۟","مَآ","أَنتُم","مُّلْقُونَ"],"en":"Moses said to them, \"Throw whatever you will throw"}},{"ar":"تِلْقَآء","kind":"noun","form":null,"count":3,"gloss":"towards; of one's own accord","word":null,"ex":{"s":28,"a":22,"p":3,"ar":["وَلَمَّا","تَوَجَّهَ","تِلْقَآءَ","مَدْيَنَ","قَالَ","عَسَىٰ","رَبِّىٓ","أَن","يَهْدِيَنِى","سَوَآءَ","ٱلسَّبِيلِ"],"en":"And when he directed himself toward Madyan, he said, \"Perhaps my Lord will guide me to the sound way"}},{"ar":"يُلَٰقُ","kind":"verb","form":3,"count":3,"gloss":"to meet","word":null,"ex":{"s":52,"a":45,"p":3,"ar":["فَذَرْهُمْ","حَتَّىٰ","يُلَـٰقُوا۟","يَوْمَهُمُ","ٱلَّذِى","فِيهِ","يُصْعَقُونَ"],"en":"So leave them until they meet their Day in which they will be struck insensible"}},{"ar":"مُلَٰقِي","kind":"active participle","form":3,"count":2,"gloss":"meeting","word":null,"ex":{"s":84,"a":6,"p":8,"ar":["يَـٰٓأَيُّهَا","ٱلْإِنسَـٰنُ","إِنَّكَ","كَادِحٌ","إِلَىٰ","رَبِّكَ","كَدْحًا","فَمُلَـٰقِيهِ"],"en":"O mankind, indeed you are laboring toward your Lord with [great] exertion and will meet it"}},{"ar":"لَٰقِي","kind":"active participle","form":3,"count":1,"gloss":"meeting","word":null,"ex":{"s":28,"a":61,"p":6,"ar":["أَفَمَن","وَعَدْنَـٰهُ","وَعْدًا","حَسَنًا","فَهُوَ","لَـٰقِيهِ","كَمَن","مَّتَّعْنَـٰهُ","مَتَـٰعَ","ٱلْحَيَوٰةِ","ٱلدُّنْيَا","ثُمَّ","هُوَ","يَوْمَ","ٱلْقِيَـٰمَةِ","مِنَ","ٱلْمُحْضَرِينَ"],"en":"Then is he whom We have promised a good promise which he will obtain like he for whom We provided enjoyment of worldly life [but] then he is, on the Day of Resurrection, among those presented [for punishment in Hell]"}},{"ar":"مُلَٰق","kind":"active participle","form":3,"count":1,"gloss":"meeting","word":null,"ex":{"s":69,"a":20,"p":4,"ar":["إِنِّى","ظَنَنتُ","أَنِّى","مُلَـٰقٍ","حِسَابِيَهْ"],"en":"Indeed, I was certain that I would be meeting my account"}},{"ar":"مُلْقِيَٰت","kind":"active participle","form":4,"count":1,"gloss":"those who deliver","word":null,"ex":{"s":77,"a":5,"p":1,"ar":["فَٱلْمُلْقِيَـٰتِ","ذِكْرًا"],"en":"And those [angels] who deliver a message"}},{"ar":"مُتَلَقِّيَان","kind":"active participle","form":5,"count":1,"gloss":"two receivers","word":null,"ex":{"s":50,"a":17,"p":3,"ar":["إِذْ","يَتَلَقَّى","ٱلْمُتَلَقِّيَانِ","عَنِ","ٱلْيَمِينِ","وَعَنِ","ٱلشِّمَالِ","قَعِيدٌ"],"en":"When the two receivers receive, seated on the right and on the left"}},{"ar":"تَّلَاق","kind":"verbal noun","form":6,"count":1,"gloss":"mutual meeting","word":null,"ex":{"s":40,"a":15,"p":16,"ar":["رَفِيعُ","ٱلدَّرَجَـٰتِ","ذُو","ٱلْعَرْشِ","يُلْقِى","ٱلرُّوحَ","مِنْ","أَمْرِهِۦ","عَلَىٰ","مَن","يَشَآءُ","مِنْ","عِبَادِهِۦ","لِيُنذِرَ","يَوْمَ","ٱلتَّلَاقِ"],"en":"[He is] the Exalted above [all] degrees, Owner of the Throne; He places the inspiration of His command upon whom He wills of His servants to warn of the Day of Meeting"}}],"surahs":[[7,11],[20,10],[10,8],[2,7],[3,7],[26,7],[28,6],[50,6],[8,5],[25,5],[4,4],[16,4],[18,4],[27,4],[41,4],[6,3],[12,3],[22,3],[32,3],[17,2],[29,2],[30,2],[40,2],[43,2],[54,2],[67,2],[84,2],[5,1],[9,1],[11,1],[13,1],[15,1],[19,1],[21,1],[23,1],[24,1],[31,1],[33,1],[37,1],[38,1],[39,1],[45,1],[47,1],[52,1],[55,1],[60,1],[62,1],[69,1],[70,1],[73,1],[75,1],[76,1],[77,1]]}